    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/9cde31b9dfbdf13c03206680e33e840f.poster.avif?t=1752485832\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/9cde31b9dfbdf13c03206680e33e840f.webm?t=1752485832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/bf2a08f6e74b5964fbf62c253c387048.avif?t=1752485832\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br>In a dystopian world inhabited by dinosaurs, take on the role of Cacops, a small amphibious dinosaur with a unique power: water control.<br><br>Immerse yourself in his world and help him on his quest to recover his stolen egg from the evil ninjas while solving intricate puzzles in his action-packed, fun-filled Jurassic world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/baca9471fa50e974379c4a4edc6912db.poster.avif?t=1752485832\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/baca9471fa50e974379c4a4edc6912db.webm?t=1752485832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/79c1b4f8177b7283f0c995d5eada4c63.avif?t=1752485832\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br>\ud83d\udd2bSimple shooting and reloading mechanics where the player will have access to special items throughout the adventure.\ud83d\udd2b<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/bea301f987256fba3b636175e4563f14.poster.avif?t=1752485832\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/bea301f987256fba3b636175e4563f14.webm?t=1752485832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>\ud83c\udfa8Modern aesthetics and a retro atmosphere where you'll find multiple nods to 80's and 90's myths.\ud83c\udfa8<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/cf84af2f226df1eb8a813fad68ad1c82.poster.avif?t=1752485832\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/cf84af2f226df1eb8a813fad68ad1c82.webm?t=1752485832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>\ud83e\udd96Unique characters and enemies with big final Bosses. \ud83e\udd95<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/96a8c6d01e7bd3f1ab19a1472bb94008.poster.avif?t=1752485832\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/96a8c6d01e7bd3f1ab19a1472bb94008.webm?t=1752485832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0fSome surprises with optional arcade-style minigames.\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651910/extras/603b0e9ef75431d0fcd6373772559c8b.poster.avif?t=1752485832\" width=620 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com